  "labelNotes": "No Recommended Operating Conditions table on these pages; supply from Table 3.2 Electrical Specifications (VDD 3.0/3.3/3.6 V). Column placement of the IDD rows checked with pdftotext: 0.6 TYP/1 MAX mA; 200 TYP uA; 300 TYP uA; 300 TYP/400 MAX uA; ISTANDBY 270 is in the MAX column. The two 300 uA TYP readings (DAC driver no load; temp monitoring disabled) have no allowed-key conditions, so they collapse to one label. Conversion-rate/mode conditions omitted. Abs max: VDD 5.0 V and 5V-tolerant pins 5.5 V labelled; the '|V5VT_pin - VDD|' 3.6 V row is a pin-to-VDD differential limit and was excluded (judgement call); 'VDD +0.3' skipped. Note 3.1 mentions pull-up resistors but prints no resistance value."
